ne of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nGrandpa dies last month, and the family is worrying about Grandma's future. On Sunday afternoon, Xiao Red comes to Grandma's house, and Grandma is watching TV in the living room. Xiao Red happily says: \"Grandma, do you see the newly opened nursing home nearby? I hear the environment is good, but I hate to part with you.\" Grandma smiles slightly, without giving an answer. Dad comes out of the kitchen, saying: \"We consider that option, but finally decide it is better for Grandma to live with us.\" Xiao Red says to Grandma: \"That's great, I can often accompany you, trying my best to make you comfortable.\"\n\n[Question]\nDoes Xiao Red know that Grandma does not want to go to the nursing home?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Knows\nB. Does not know","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af592389aa9dc5a833d7460","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794478648115,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:17:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"49583994084947c8b8de1c369179e32f"}